<div class="cot-container">
    <header class="mb-3">
        <h1>Chain-of-Thought Prompting</h1>
        <p class="cot-lead">Guide models to reason step-by-step so that answers become transparent, auditable, and easier to trust in production workflows.</p>
    </header>

